  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 579c9253f6a5be6499ca8a1851d07f90, type: 3}
  welcomeMessage: Welcome to Lesson 3 Instrument Sounds Quiz.
  letsLearnMessage: In this quiz, you're going to tell whether the given instruments
    produces loud or soft sound and high or low pitch sounds. Press dot 1 if you
    think the instrument produces loud or high pitch sound or Press dot 2 if you
    think the instrument produces Soft or low pitch sound.
  completedMessage: Great Job! You finished Lesson 3 Instrument Sounds Quiz.
  repeatQuestionMessage: You finished Lesson 3, Instrument Sounds. Do you want to
    repeat again? Press repeat to repeat or Next to go back to continue.
  lessonChoiceMessage: You have finished learning about instrument sounds. Press
    repeat to repeat the lesson or press next to begin the quiz.
  lessonChoiceAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c61166ed3a076df43b849cbb8ea9e18c, type: 3}
  lessonPages:
  - title: 
    lessonText: Welcome to Lesson 3, Instrument Sounds.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3ac86c0dc0e8a0d4b89698f502c09801, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Now that you've learned some of the common sounds produced by an
      animals, lets now focus into learning what are the sounds produced by a different
      instruments.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ba646b7b03e33754fbd8da899719d80e, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Musical instruments are objects that make music when we play them.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e665a79048acdda4ebf756694c759000, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Some instruments are loud. Some are soft. Each instrument has its
      own special sound.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9e6877c7ccab3f740822a70cc2a9df1c, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Listen carefully. The sound can help you know which instrument is
      playing.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8502b63921a618842a7891d9d50fb344, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Now, let's learn the sounds of different musical instruments!
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ae752799ce31e7145861c919969594f3, type: 3}
  - title: Guitar
    lessonText: For an example, a Guitar.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3df0c0a726f63494eb0192349b981522, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c6d23041565d53e45aef822b7d15e582, type: 3}
  - title: Guitar
    lessonText: A guitar has strings that are plucked or strummed.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3df0c0a726f63494eb0192349b981522, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d5a9fa5e53007564884adc62b72bce46, type: 3}
  - title: Guitar
    lessonText: The guitar makes a soft and pleasant sound.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3df0c0a726f63494eb0192349b981522, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ea31f0cd6a6f45e409fae6ec29e76d32, type: 3}
  - title: Guitar
    lessonText: 
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3df0c0a726f63494eb0192349b981522, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 89578f59890358643a9c68ce20950c27, type: 3}
  - title: Trumpet
    lessonText: Next up, a trumpet.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 04e25486fec78ea4b8c1a4b727466f86, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2fba249a5b7527449a027e514b2d3ae5, type: 3}
  - title: Trumpet
    lessonText: A trumpet is a wind instrument that you can play by blowing air through
      the mouthpiece.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 04e25486fec78ea4b8c1a4b727466f86, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a8bb8ec24a65fe2428b967540714ecaf, type: 3}
  - title: Trumpet
    lessonText: It makes a bright and loud sound.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 04e25486fec78ea4b8c1a4b727466f86, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0bc9c003fff4d8a4fbbae7ba6f8ac8e6, type: 3}
  - title: Trumpet
    lessonText: 
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 04e25486fec78ea4b8c1a4b727466f86, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1e60e6199f00ce04591ef72fe60c7ee9, type: 3}
  - title: Violin
    lessonText: Next up, Violin.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c76e548ba17798c43b42497d430ef153, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a3c16053e3c8f7c419974be76968dd44, type: 3}
  - title: Violin
    lessonText: A violin has strings which make sound when you move a bow across
      them.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c76e548ba17798c43b42497d430ef153, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e9b4939987f180e41960037de90eb2f4, type: 3}
  - title: Violin
    lessonText: The violin makes smooth and gentle sounds.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c76e548ba17798c43b42497d430ef153, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 43f1ed7e18222d546bad558d6dea77a6, type: 3}
  - title: Violin
    lessonText: 
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c76e548ba17798c43b42497d430ef153, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4a31482cad5b71b4cb299b3445840322, type: 3}
  - title: Maracas
    lessonText: Next up, Maracas.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8974440abe223bb45b2df1a6f9730da6, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e141129844bfb304d843088466a67577, type: 3}
  - title: Maracas
    lessonText: Maracas are musical instruments that you shake with your hands.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8974440abe223bb45b2df1a6f9730da6, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 83a2e98a574e8024c9cd5c0632345afd, type: 3}
  - title: Maracas
    lessonText: Inside each maraca are small seeds or beads.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8974440abe223bb45b2df1a6f9730da6, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d6cc9fca01f0446409154e040133388b, type: 3}
  - title: Maracas
    lessonText: When you shake the maraca, the seeds or beads hit the inside and
      make a sound.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8974440abe223bb45b2df1a6f9730da6, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3c73ca6488c95b64c94a0c00c17e3bdf, type: 3}
  - title: Maracas
    lessonText: Maracas make a soft, shaking sound.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8974440abe223bb45b2df1a6f9730da6, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6cf5d2d1727f7af419234597c4f20379, type: 3}
  - title: Maracas
    lessonText: 
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8974440abe223bb45b2df1a6f9730da6, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9877f08d8b3a696439b4ce2d4deca631, type: 3}
  - title: Bass Drum
    lessonText: Next up, Bass Drum.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ce3340667bb69f946a294221540623c7, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ff1425a6056e92a4fbca3b8724556a6b, type: 3}
  - title: Bass Drum
    lessonText: A bass drum is a very big drum.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ce3340667bb69f946a294221540623c7, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d2632307f8eb78340a955e3829568998, type: 3}
  - title: Bass Drum
    lessonText: It makes sound when you hit it with a soft drumstick.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ce3340667bb69f946a294221540623c7, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 262e2463eb67d0140a91aa2d78f1f9a5, type: 3}
  - title: Bass Drum
    lessonText: Because it is big, it makes a deep and loud sound.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ce3340667bb69f946a294221540623c7, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 32ebd772889cde544968981ee245b1fd, type: 3}
  - title: Bass Drum
    lessonText: The bass drum helps keep the beat in music.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ce3340667bb69f946a294221540623c7, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bd57d9d7dd9defc43814837a613bbba2, type: 3}
  - title: Bass Drum
    lessonText: 
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ce3340667bb69f946a294221540623c7, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dcb9dc7f9182ac044b11cd47d0b45654, type: 3}
  - title: Quad Drum
    lessonText: Next up, Quad Drum.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5a742827a5e7d4146a19a759c9ebe007, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0f39008f6046ea24894971b6bccd9a9c, type: 3}
  - title: Quad Drum
    lessonText: A quad drum is made of four small drums joined together.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5a742827a5e7d4146a19a759c9ebe007, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 21b8543d178e00944859451350451406, type: 3}
  - title: Quad Drum
    lessonText: It makes sound when you hit the drums with drumsticks.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5a742827a5e7d4146a19a759c9ebe007, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f891e1aef0707ea48affe07621e8f347, type: 3}
  - title: Quad Drum
    lessonText: Each drum makes a different sound.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5a742827a5e7d4146a19a759c9ebe007, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6dbe7f8fa77033841864daba97a1f098, type: 3}
  - title: Quad Drum
    lessonText: Players move their sticks from one drum to another to make music.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5a742827a5e7d4146a19a759c9ebe007, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9920367cc27a2df46bb10ae344d43608, type: 3}
  - title: Quad Drum
    lessonText: 
    lessonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5a742827a5e7d4146a19a759c9ebe007, type: 3}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 12e7bc10db4ae60449177b53a6828a5a, type: 3}
